": "text", "text": "(lyr.): as Subst.: φίλος, ὁ, friend, κουρίδιος φίλος, i.e. husband,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 15.22", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; φίλοι friends, kith and kin,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "νόσφιφίλων Il. 14.256", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τῆλεφίλων Od. 2.333", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "6.287", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; φ. μέγιστος my greatest friend,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Aj. 1331", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; φίλοι οἱ ἐγγυτάτω, οἱ ἔγγιστα,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Lys. 1.41", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "codd.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Plb. 9.24.2", "author_abbreviation": "Plb.", "tlg_author": "0543", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; after"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "freq. with a gen.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὁ Διὸς φίλος A. Pr. 306", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τοὺς ἐμαυτοῦ φ., τοὺς τούτων φ.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Aeschin. 1.47", "author_abbreviation": "Aeschin.", "tlg_author": "0026", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "φ. ἐμός S. Ph. 421", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τῶν ἐμε ͂ν φ. ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "509", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοὺς σφετέρους φ. X. HG 4.8.25", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": prov., ἔστιν ὁ φ. ἄλλος αὐτός a friend is another self,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Arist. EN 1166a31", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κοινὰ τὰ τῶν φ. Pl. Phdr. 279c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Arist. EN 1159b31", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐθεὶς φ. ᾧ πολλοὶ φ. Id. EE 1245b20", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also of friends or allies, opp. πολέμιοι,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. HG 6.5.48", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "φ. καὶ σύμμαχος D. 9.12", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; of a lover,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Mem. 3.11.4", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(in bad sense,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Lac. 2.13", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "); φίλε my friend, as a form of courteous address,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ev.Luc. 14.10", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0031", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; in relation to things,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οἱ μουσικῆς φ. E. Fr. 580.3", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀληθείας Pl. R. 487a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τῶν εἰδῶν Id. Sph. 248a", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Χίους φ. ποιῆσαι Lys. 14.36", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "014", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.;"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ποιεῖσθαι Luc. Pisc. 38", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0062", "tlg_work": "025", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κτᾶσθαι Isoc. 2.27", "author_abbreviation": "Isoc.", "tlg_author": "0010", "tlg_work": "013", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 2.40", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "φίλους τιθέντες τούς γε πολεμιωτάτους E. Hec. 848", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "φίλῳ χρῆσθαί τινι Antipho 5.63", "author_abbreviation": "Antipho", "tlg_author": "0028", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἡμᾶς ἔχειν φίλους And. 1.40", "author_abbreviation": "And.", "tlg_author": "0027", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; for"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 3.49", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", v. φίλιος. φίλη, ἡ, dear one, friend,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κλῦτε, φίλαι Od. 4.722", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "λόγοις ἐγὼ φιλοῦσαν οὐ στέργω φίλην S. Ant. 543", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; of a wife, φίλην τινὰ ἄγεσθαι take as one's wife,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 9.146", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "288", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἡ Ξέρξου φ., of his mother,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pers. 832", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; of a mistress,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Mem. 2.1.23", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "3.11.16", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "φίλην ποιήσασθαί τινα Antipho 1.14", "author_abbreviation": "Antipho", "tlg_author": "0028", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". φίλον, τό, an object of love, τὸ φ. σέβεσθαι to reverence what the city loves,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OC 187", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(lyr.): addressed to persons, darling,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "φ. ἐμόν Ar. Ec. 952", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(lyr.); so φίλτατον ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "970", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὰ φίλτατα one's nearest and dearest, dear ones, such as wife and children,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pers. 851", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Eu. 216", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OT 366", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "OC 1110", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Med. 16", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": v. φίλτατος; τἀμὰ φίλα, τὰ σὰ φ. ,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. Ion 523", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(troch.),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "613", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". οἱ πρῶτοι φίλοι, a title at the Ptolemaic court,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "OGI 99.3", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PTeb. 11.4", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(ii B. C.), etc.; or simply"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οἱ φ. τοῦ βασιλέως OGI 100.1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; or οἱ φ. alone, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "115.4", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τῶν φ. και διοικητοῦ one of the king's friends and dioecetes,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PTeb. 79.56", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(ii B. C.). of things, pleasant, welcome,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δόσις ὀλίγη τε φ. τε Od. 6.208", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 1.167", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": c. dat. pers.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αἰεὶ γάρ τοι ἔρις τε φίλη 5.891", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 8.248", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "13.295", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐ φίλα τοι ἐρέω Hdt. 7.104", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δαίμοσιν πράσσειν φίλα their pleasure,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pr. 660", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. infr."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". freq. as predic., φίλον ἐστί or γίγνεταί μοι pleases me, it is after my own heart,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἴ πού